    <div class="blog-article__feature">
      <img src="/assets/images/blog/ctc-vs-in-hand-salary-feature.jpg" alt="CTC vs in-hand salary: understand the real difference, salary breakdown and what you actually take home" width="1200" height="630" loading="eager" style="width:100%;height:auto;border-radius:var(--radius-md);">
