    <p>Your gross salary is about ₹11.86 lakh annually, but your CTC is ₹15 lakh because the employer adds ₹3.14 lakh in non-cash components on top of it.</p>

    <h2>The Deductions That Hit You Every Month</h2>
    <p>Even from your gross salary, several amounts get deducted before the money lands in your account. These are deductions from you — the employee — not extras paid by the employer.</p>
    <table class="data-table">
      <caption>Monthly deductions from gross salary — ₹15 LPA employee</caption>
      <thead><tr><th>Deduction</th><th>Monthly Amount</th><th>Notes</th></tr></thead>
