    <h2>The CTC Gap at Different Salary Levels</h2>
    <p>The gap between CTC and take-home isn't uniform. At higher salaries, income tax takes a much larger chunk. Here's a quick comparison across common CTC bands for AY 2026-27, assuming the <strong>new tax regime</strong> (default from FY 2024-25):</p>
    <table class="data-table">
      <caption>Approximate take-home by CTC level — new tax regime, AY 2026-27</caption>
