      </tbody>
    </table>
    <p>The gap widens significantly as income grows, mainly because income tax rates are progressive — the more you earn, the higher percentage you pay on each additional rupee. Want to calculate your exact take-home without guesswork? Use <a href="/india/ctc-to-in-hand-calculator/">CalcPhi's free CTC to In-Hand Calculator</a> — plug in your CTC and get a full monthly breakdown in seconds.</p>

